{"timestamp":"2026-11-02T08:21:02.143Z","ordinal":34935,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a19b58-fa3f-79b0-a72e-9854f9cf3694","author":"/root/release_gate_audit","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/release_gate_audit\nPayload:\nNo response is recorded after the AC4 GATEWAY ruling request. The GATEWAY claim still belongs to the RC15 holder on `ubuntu-desktop`, and the current roster has no holder agent.\n\nWP-1104’s full suite is green and its SUITE claim is free, but AC4 evidence is still outstanding. The release notes still describe v1.1.2 as a narrow patch, not the full WP-1101..1108 scope.\n\n**Safe next step:** hold tagging and publication. Resolve the AC4 GATEWAY ruling, record the six-task acceptance evidence, and reconcile the release tracker and notes to the full scope before qualifying a candidate."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a19b3e-e325-7090-bf1f-c31aa606240e","create_time":1793607662.143239,"content_item_metadata":[{"provenance":{"type":"tool","namespace":"collaboration"}}]}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":1521}}
