-only acceptance does not consume the GATEWAY claim; any remote/provider-backed inference still requires that claim.\n+\n+This gate closes the WP-1103/1104 source slice only. It does not qualify a tagged release artifact or satisfy the full WP-1101..WP-1108 roadmap. `docs/releases/v1.1.2.md` still describes a narrower patch and must be reconciled with the user's full-roadmap scope before publication. The built archive predates the source commit and does not carry an explicit source-commit binding; it is not exact-commit release evidence.\n+\n - A first `npm test` run on `/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1104-suite-snapshot` was diagnostic only: the snapshot had no `cli/dist/index.js` or Rust core binaries, and `NEXUS_PACKAGE_ROOT` was unset so the actual package smoke was skipped. Its test runner reported 1,981 tests (1,739 pass, 222 fail) and then remained in `turn_semantics.test.ts` with repeated provider-recovery retries; that process was interrupted after about 40 minutes. This is not accepted full-suite evidence.\n","move_path":null}},"status":"completed","stdout":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM /home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1104-integration/docs/v1.1.0/WP-1104-PLAN.md\n","stderr":""},"started_at_ms":1793613781967,"completed_at_ms":1793613781980}}
