{"timestamp":"2026-11-02T10:05:58.421Z","ordinal":37937,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0fd4138577b17921016ae86083172081a38666ff80272cd829","status":"completed","call_id":"call_770c20d0bfe44fa1b946375b52ab81f2","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1104-integration/docs/v1.1.0/WP-1104-PLAN.md\\n@@\\n This gate closes the WP-1103/1104 source slice only. It does not qualify a tagged release artifact or satisfy the full WP-1101..WP-1108 roadmap. `docs/releases/v1.1.2.md` still describes a narrower patch and must be reconciled with the user's full-roadmap scope before publication. The built archive predates the source commit and does not carry an explicit source-commit binding; it is not exact-commit release evidence.\\n+\\n+### WP-1104 tracker closeout\\n+\\n+- **Status:** done for the standalone CLI, package runtime closure, and six-task dataset execution acceptance delivered by this slice.\\n+- **Commit:** `05c49df2` (`feat(eval): package and run the versioned evaluator`).\\n+- **Test evidence:** `npm test` completed with 2,138 tests, 2,136 passed, 0 failed, 2 skipped; process-scope postcheck passed. Log SHA-256: `19aeb576f3be4f45b7507d79a0a1cfda1a46e9caebca59f87de9e60b17bf5a16`.\\n+- **Type/build gate:** `npm run build` passed on the committed source tree.\\n+- **Independent review:** `/root/review_delta` returned **APPROVED** for commit `05c49df2`, including the gate record and candidate evidence; reviewer did not rerun the suite.\\n+- **Retrieval log:** XERJ entries above, including `nexus-test/eval_integrity.test.ts:1729` and `nexus-test/eval_harness.test.ts:43`.\\n+- **Release qualification boundary:** this tracker closeout is not exact-tag or publication approval; retain the full-roadmap and release-scope guards above.\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a19b9f-f23a-70e0-bbf9-0ad