{"timestamp":"2026-11-02T10:38:24.783Z","ordinal":38963,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"task_complete","root_turn_id":"01a19bd4-0675-7382-8fda-7e48c2399751","turn_id":"01a19bd4-0675-7382-8fda-7e48c2399751","last_agent_message":"The full suite is still running and advancing through the remaining tests; the runner is live. No aggregate result or process-scope postcheck is available yet, so WP-1103 remains open. The roadmap audit still shows no separate safe slice to claim while the existing handoffs are unresolved.\n\nNEXUS-STATUS\n  agent: Nexus-Release-Agent\n  item: WP-1103 — Oracle isolation, AC2 evidence\n  phase: GREEN\n  claim: SUITE + candidate evidence path (held)\n  heartbeat: 2026-11-02T10:37:31Z\n  gate: test=IN PROGRESS  types=N/A  lint=N/A\n  retrieval: corpus=nexus-cli query=\"sandbox probe and run_command wrapper\" hit=sandbox.ts:183; tools.ts:1523\n  next: Continue monitoring live suite session 8783, then verify its summary, postcheck and evidence before commit and independent review.\n  friction: None new.","started_at":1793615726,"completed_at":1793615904,"duration_ms":178572,"time_to_first_token_ms":4593}}
