thorized task again (4049.179903ms)\n  ✔ partial history after a write (the obligation record survives): resume blocks without inference, and only an explicit restart runs the authorized task again (5658.128427ms)\n  ✔ missing durable state (task file deleted): resume blocks without inference, and only an explicit restart runs the authorized task again (4178.899822ms)\n  ✔ a task file written before obligations were recorded, with no conversation: resume blocks without inference, and only an explicit restart runs the authorized task again (3687.59444ms)\n  ✔ a conversation truncated to its system prompt, with no obligation record: resume blocks without inference, and only an explicit restart runs the authorized task again (3705.438802ms)\n  ✔ a compacted recovered conversation continues its task but cannot claim verified completion (3254.741574ms)\n  ✔ a conversation where nothing happened yet (only the system prompt) starts the unit, without a restart decision (3765.878349ms)\n  ✔ an operator revision continues the recorded conversation but keeps recovered changes unverified (3142.694503ms)\n2717 wp1103-ac2-suite.log\n    PID    PPID     ELAPSED STAT COMMAND\n1523563    6832       20:25 Ss   zsh\n1524356 1524331       20:23 Sl   MainThread\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":1,"nanos":534121468}},"started_at_ms":1793615939726,"completed_at_ms":1793615941261}}
