{"timestamp":"2026-11-02T10:53:27.637Z","ordinal":39317,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","id":"fco_01a19be4-86d5-76f2-a893-61e40862929d","call_id":"call_4382da84640243a7ac655cca9e25639b","output":"{\"agents\":[{\"agent_name\":\"/root\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/review_delta\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"**APPROVED.** The AC2 addendum is testable and bounded to the existing dataset-isolation test. Its assertions observe the candidate’s `/workspace` mount, absence of the dataset staging root from mountinfo, and unreadability of the absolute validator path, while retaining the staged-tree and sentinel checks ([test](/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1104-integration/cli/test/eval_dataset.test.ts:87), [addendum](/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1104-integration/docs/v1.1.0/WP-1103-ORACLE-ISOLATION.md:39)).\\n\\nThe references fit: they point to the real sandbox probe and `run_command` wrapper, with the evaluator’s `/tmp` and `/workspace` mounts identified through local source inspection. Both changed files have active claims on this worktree. The documented focused pass is evidence for this change; full integration gates remain separate.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/roadmap_status_audit\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"The suite process has exited, and its log shows 2,138 tests: 2,136 passed, 0 failed, 2 skipped; the process-scope check passed. The retention group took about 11 minutes. I can confirm the D-state ended with process completion, but not its cause.\\n\\nWP-1104 is committed and independently approved. Its closeout explicitly limits completion to WP-1103/1104 source and acceptance work, not full-roadmap release qualification. I found no next implementation slice that is both ready and safe to claim: WP-1101 and WP-1106 need files still claimed by PR396; WP-1102/1105 handoffs remain unresolved; WP-1107 is claimed; WP-1108 spans shared infrastructure. I sent the refreshed state and evidence details to the parent.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/v112_next_slice_audit\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"No safe implementation slice is ready to claim.\\n\\nWP-1101 is blocked by active claims on `cli/src/agent.ts` and `cli/src/client.ts`; its old branch is not a clean handoff. WP-1108’s branch is 45 commits behind the WP-1104 integration head and overlaps several integration files. Its state-test and helper handoff records remain unresolved, and CI workflow edits require shared-infrastructure coordination.\\n\\nThe unclaimed `scripts/check_deprecated_lock.mjs` could support a bounded WP-1108 test slice, but it currently performs live npm registry requests and has no test seam. It needs a deterministic test plan and explicit tracker scope before it is ready.\\n\\n**Next step:** Have the roadmap owner scope an isolated WP-1108 item or obtain clean handoffs; do not continue from the stale branches.\"}}]}","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a19be2-b7d8-7d70-997b-e6f394731115","create_time":1793616807.6377575}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
