{"timestamp":"2026-11-02T11:03:29.617Z","ordinal":39573,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a192c0-f277-7f60-8574-21ce71edb8c2","turn_id":"01a19be9-451f-7a92-b2a7-6e0a6065a620","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0fd4138577b17921016ae86e001c1081a38923c7cf6a7619c7","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The full-suite run remains live and has advanced through the REPL and verification tests, with no aggregate test failure reported. I also confirmed the WP-1103 umbrella and runner claims point to the integration worktree; the generic `acceptance.json` claim still points to the old worktree and needs reconciliation before closeout.\n\nNEXUS-STATUS\n  agent: Nexus-Release-Agent\n  item: WP-1103 — Oracle isolation, AC2 evidence\n  phase: GREEN\n  claim: SUITE + candidate evidence path (held)\n  heartbeat: 2026-11-02T11:02:11Z\n  gate: test=IN PROGRESS  types=N/A  lint=N/A\n  retrieval: corpus=nexus-cli query=\"sandbox probe and run_command wrapper\" hit=sandbox.ts:183; tools.ts:1523\n  next: Continue live session 8783; capture the suite summary and postcheck, then reconcile the stale evidence claim and request independent review.\n  friction: Generic acceptance.json claim still names the old runner-reclaim worktree. Preserve its untracked files."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1793617408128,"completed_at_ms":1793617409617}}
