{"timestamp":"2026-11-02T12:13:09.028Z","ordinal":41657,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0fd4138577b17921016ae87e53b9ac81a3a556623ef64df150","status":"completed","call_id":"call_1489d6d98518417c8b8102416acf3dc4","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-scope-reconciliation/docs/releases/v1.1.2.md\\n@@\\n-This document records the target scope; it does not claim that the roadmap is implemented or qualified. Work-package completion, exact-head test and type gates, independent review, release-candidate qualification, and publication are still required before v1.1.2 can be called released. Track implementation and evidence in the work-package plans and release qualification record.\\n+This document records the target scope; it does not claim that the roadmap is implemented or qualified. As of this note, roadmap implementation and v1.1.2 qualification remain incomplete; completion requires recording the applicable evidence. Work-package completion, exact-head test and type gates, independent review, release-candidate qualification, and publication are still required before v1.1.2 can be called released. Track implementation and evidence in the work-package plans and release qualification record.\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a19c21-eae7-7351-8f59-ab15f352b0bf","create_time":1793621587.7266681}}}
