{"timestamp":"2026-11-02T12:21:45.849Z","ordinal":42103,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a192c0-f277-7f60-8574-21ce71edb8c2","turn_id":"01a19c2f-dea4-71b3-98ee-cb4f44bcaab4","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0fd4138577b17921016ae88055beb081a38452d48a58bebde4","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"I made progress toward v1.1.2, but the release is still open.\n\n- The full WP-1101–WP-1108 scope is recorded in [the v1.1.2 release notes](/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-scope-reconciliation/docs/releases/v1.1.2.md), commit `4b63cee0`. The documentation checks passed and `/root/review_delta` approved it. The commit is local and unpushed.\n- GitHub shows v1.1.1 published, no v1.1.0 release, and no v1.1.2 release or tag. The immutable v1.1.0 tags remain; I will not reuse that version.\n- WP-1103 still needs a clean exact-source full-suite run. The prior run was red and overlapped other test traffic. At 12:21 UTC, the PR396 test processes were still live, so I did not start another run.\n- Collaboration audits found no safe independent package to pick up now: WP-1105 depends on WP-1103 and has untracked prior-owner work; WP-1106 needs a handoff for `cli/src/agent.ts`; WP-1108 has no PR or CI evidence and substantial acceptance work outstanding.\n\n**Next:** once the live test process exits, verify the host is clear, claim `SUITE`, and qualify WP-1103 on the exact integration source. The release goal remains active.\n\n```text\nNEXUS-STATUS\n  agent: Nexus-Release-Agent\n  item: v1.1.2 — full WP-1101..WP-1108 roadmap\n  phase: ORIENT\n  claim: WP-1103 test/plan claims held; scope-doc claim released\n  heartbeat: 2026-11-02 12:21 UTC\n  gate: test=FAIL (prior contaminated run)  types=PENDING  lint=N/A\n  retrieval: corpus=nexus-test query=\"eval_dataset\" hit=AC2 focused test 3/3\n  next: Wait for PR396 test processes to exit, then claim SUITE and rerun WP-1103 against the exact integration source.\n  friction: Shared test host remains occupied by another agent’s suite.\n```\n\n"}],"phase":"final_answer","memory_citation":{"entries":[{"path":"MEMORY.md","lineStart":646,"lineEnd":650,"note":"release coordination and serialized suite boundaries"},{"path":"skills/nexus-release-qualification/SKILL.md","lineStart":41,"lineEnd":54,"note":"source review and exact-candidate qualification are separate gates"}],"rolloutIds":[]}},"started_at_ms":1793622101764,"completed_at_ms":1793622105849}}
{"timestamp":"2026-11-02T12:21:45.855Z","ordinal":42104,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","status":"completed","id":"msg_0fd4138577b17921016ae88055beb081a38452d48a58bebde4","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"I made progress toward v1.1.2, but the release is still open.\n\n- The full WP-1101–WP-1108 scope is recorded in [the v1.1.2 release notes](/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-scope-reconciliation/docs/releases/v1.1.2.md), commit `4b63cee0`. The documentation checks passed and `/root/review_delta` approved it. The commit is local and unpushed.\n- GitHub shows v1.1.1 published, no v1.1.0 release, and no v1.1.2 release or tag. The immutable v1.1.0 tags remain; I will not reuse that version.\n- WP-1103 still needs a clean exact-source full-suite run. The prior run was red and overlapped other test traffic. At 12:21 UTC, the PR396 test processes were still live, so I did not start another run.\n- Collaboration audits found no safe independent package to pick up now: WP-1105 depends on WP-1103 and has untracked prior-owner work; WP-1106 needs a handoff for `cli/src/agent.ts`; WP-1108 has no PR or CI evidence and substantial acceptance work outstanding.\n\n**Next:** once the live test process exits, verify the host is clear, claim `SUITE`, and qualify WP-1103 on the exact integration source. The release goal remains active.\n\n```text\nNEXUS-STATUS\n  agent: Nexus-Release-Agent\n  item: v1.1.2 — full WP-1101..WP-1108 roadmap\n  phase: ORIENT\n  claim: WP-1103 test/plan claims held; scope-doc claim released\n  heartbeat: 2026-11-02 12:21 UTC\n  gate: test=FAIL (prior contaminated run)  types=PENDING  lint=N/A\n  retrieval: corpus=nexus-test query=\"eval_dataset\" hit=AC2 focused test 3/3\n  next: Wait for PR396 test processes to exit, then claim SUITE and rerun WP-1103 against the exact integration source.\n  friction: Shared test host remains occupied by another agent’s suite.\n```\n\n<oai-mem-citation>\n<citation_entries>\nMEMORY.md:646-650|note=[release coordination and serialized suite boundaries]\nskills/nexus-release-qualification/SKILL.md:41-54|note=[source review and exact-candidate qualification are separate gates]\n</citation_entries>\n<rollout_ids>\n</rollout_ids>\n</oai-mem-citation>","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a19c2f-dea4-71b3-98ee-cb4f44bcaab4","create_time":1793622101.7459428,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}},"metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_0fd4138577b17921016ae88055beb081a38452d48a58bebde4","turn_id":"01a19c2f-dea4-71b3-98ee-cb4f44bcaab4","role":"assistant"},"revision":"retained_01a19c35-5eff-7f12-86ae-baac7f3eaf61","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":1702}}
