{"timestamp":"2026-11-02T12:23:41.492Z","ordinal":42214,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0fd4138577b17921016ae880ca737481a3b680fc55c797f702","status":"completed","call_id":"call_a4352c055e8e40f3afc91506927adebc","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-rc-scope/docs/releases/v1.1.2-rc.1.md\\n@@\\n-**Release Candidate 1 for Nexus Code v1.1.2**: a patch release on the v1.1.1 line with one operation message-delivery fix.\\n+**Superseded draft — not tagged, published, or qualified.** This file described an earlier patch-only PR #377 candidate. The v1.1.0 release failed and published no release files; v1.1.1 is the published predecessor. The approved v1.1.2 target is now the full [WP-1101–WP-1108 roadmap](../v1.1.0/ROADMAP.md). This draft's patch-only scope and qualification statements do not qualify or define v1.1.2.\\n \\n-## Fixed\\n+## Historical patch-only draft contents\\n+\\n+The sections below preserve the earlier PR #377 draft for reference. They are not the complete v1.1.2 release notes or qualification record.\\n+\\n+### Proposed correction\\n@@\\n-Resume now recognises each message in a submitted prompt's messages block, whatever its position. Matching is still limited to prompts that Nexus issued (`isSubmittedUnitPrompt`, from v1.1.1), so marker text in model output, tool output, or files cannot suppress a message.\\n+The proposed change made resume recognise each message in a submitted prompt's messages block, whatever its position. Matching remained limited to prompts that Nexus issued (`isSubmittedUnitPrompt`, from v1.1.1), so marker text in model output, tool output, or files could not suppress a message.\\n@@\\n-This candidate inherits the v1.1.1 qualification record. The source change is limited to `cli/src/core/operation_runner_execution.ts` (`unsubmittedMessages` and a new `promptCarriesMessage` helper) and its test. Release qualification for this RC is the release workflow's gates (version, notes, provenance), plus independent review of the fix (PR #377) and of this candidate.\\n+**Qualification status: none.** This draft does not inherit v1.1.1 qualification and is not an accepted v1.1.2 release candidate. Qualification remains open and must cover the full WP-1101–WP-1108 scope on the exact final candidate, including the required release gates, independent review, and release acceptance. The PR #377 change described above is historical candidate context only.\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a19c35-8dbf-7b72-9a43-c0e91b05ed32","create_time":1793622218.4523044}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-11-02T12:23:41.520Z","ordinal":42215,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a192c0-f277-7f60-8574-21ce71edb8c2","turn_id":"01a19c35-8dbf-7b72-9a43-c0e91b05ed32","item":{"type":"FileChange","id":"exec-90843103-fd12-4493-8f51-c2e50089cf11","changes":{"/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-rc-scope/docs/releases/v1.1.2-rc.1.md":{"type":"update","unified_diff":"@@ -2,5 +2,9 @@\n \n-**Release Candidate 1 for Nexus Code v1.1.2**: a patch release on the v1.1.1 line with one operation message-delivery fix.\n+**Superseded draft — not tagged, published, or qualified.** This file described an earlier patch-only PR #377 candidate. The v1.1.0 release failed and published no release files; v1.1.1 is the published predecessor. The approved v1.1.2 target is now the full [WP-1101–WP-1108 roadmap](../v1.1.0/ROADMAP.md). This draft's patch-only scope and qualification statements do not qualify or define v1.1.2.\n+\n+## Historical patch-only draft contents\n+\n+The sections below preserve the earlier PR #377 draft for reference. They are not the complete v1.1.2 release notes or qualification record.\n \n-## Fixed\n+### Proposed correction\n \n@@ -10,3 +14,3 @@\n \n-Resume now recognises each message in a submitted prompt's messages block, whatever its position. Matching is still limited to prompts that Nexus issued (`isSubmittedUnitPrompt`, from v1.1.1), so marker text in model output, tool output, or files cannot suppress a message.\n+The proposed change made resume recognise each message in a submitted prompt's messages block, whatever its position. Matching remained limited to prompts that Nexus issued (`isSubmittedUnitPrompt`, from v1.1.1), so marker text in model output, tool output, or files could not suppress a message.\n \n@@ -29,2 +33,2 @@\n \n-This candidate inherits the v1.1.1 qualification record. The source change is limited to `cli/src/core/operation_runner_execution.ts` (`unsubmittedMessages` and a new `promptCarriesMessage` helper) and its test. Release qualification for this RC is the release workflow's gates (version, notes, provenance), plus independent review of the fix (PR #377) and of this candidate.\n+**Qualification status: none.** This draft does not inherit v1.1.1 qualification and is not an accepted v1.1.2 release candidate. Qualification remains open and must cover the full WP-1101–WP-1108 scope on the exact final candidate, including the required release gates, independent review, and release acceptance. The PR #377 change described above is historical candidate context only.\n","move_path":null}},"status":"completed","stdout":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM /home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-rc-scope/docs/releases/v1.1.2-rc.1.md\n","stderr":""},"started_at_ms":1793622221519,"completed_at_ms":1793622221520}}
