{"timestamp":"2026-11-02T12:25:53.092Z","ordinal":42345,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a192c0-f277-7f60-8574-21ce71edb8c2","turn_id":"01a19c35-8dbf-7b72-9a43-c0e91b05ed32","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0fd4138577b17921016ae881501c4881a389dfd0ea758a60ab","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The current suite is making progress—the log advanced through compaction tests—but its test worker remains live, so I’m still holding off on any test run. A peer approved a separate v1.1.2 qualification matrix plan; it will track each roadmap package and release gate without treating partial evidence as a pass."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1793622352127,"completed_at_ms":1793622353092}}
