{"timestamp":"2026-11-02T12:41:50.765Z","ordinal":42786,"type":"token_usage_record","payload":{"thread_id":"01a192c0-f277-7f60-8574-21ce71edb8c2","turn_id":"01a19c45-79f8-74d0-bea2-bdff6a04336d","session_id":"01a192c0-f277-7f60-8574-21ce71edb8c2","root_turn_id":"01a19c45-79f8-74d0-bea2-bdff6a04336d","response_id":"resp_0fd4138577b17921016ae8850dace881a3a141780e6b5900cf","usage":{"input_tokens":207899,"cached_input_tokens":207616,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":24,"reasoning_output_tokens":7,"total_tokens":207923},"turn_token_usage":{"input_tokens":3231695,"cached_input_tokens":3212032,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":9989,"reasoning_output_tokens":5881,"total_tokens":3241684},"thread_token_usage":{"input_tokens":824223620,"cached_input_tokens":817216896,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":1734080,"reasoning_output_tokens":885832,"total_tokens":825957700}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-11-02T12:41:52.370Z","ordinal":42787,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","id":"fco_01a19c47-c7f2-7ba3-a149-baf6f88a14ec","call_id":"call_234cfc3ef9b5442d84945c3859c2e5fe","output":"{\"agents\":[{\"agent_name\":\"/root\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/review_delta\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/v112_gate_matrix\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"## v1.1.2 roadmap and gate audit\\n\\nThe roadmap defines eight packages and five release gates in [ROADMAP.md](/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-scope-reconciliation/docs/v1.1.0/ROADMAP.md:44). Its package status is **not release-qualified**. The cross-slice audit in [WP-1104-PLAN.md](/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-scope-reconciliation/docs/v1.1.0/WP-1104-PLAN.md:77) is explicitly an audit lead; it requires revalidation on the integrated exact head.\\n\\n| Package | Evidence found | Status |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| WP-1101 tracing | `8a83c9e7` prototype lacks runtime event wiring and branch-head gate evidence. | **Open** |\\n| WP-1102 redaction | `ee7c8b1e` has partial redaction work; operator acceptance remains pending. | **Open** |\\n| WP-1103 datasets | Six-task installed-candidate test/evidence exists, but it proves execution coverage and request capture only. The latest full suite logged 2,133 pass, 3 fail, 2 skipped; fresh full-slice review is pending. | **Partial, unqualified** |\\n| WP-1104 standalone CLI | Source slice commits `05c49df2` and `2a94f62e` were reviewed and build-tested. Six-task focused package acceptance is recorded, but the final integrated candidate and full-slice review are not qualified. | **Source slice closed; release gate open** |\\n| WP-1105 evaluators | Worktree has untracked evaluator files, no commit or test evidence, and the documented WP-1103 dependency is still open. | **Open; preserve prior-owner work** |\\n| WP-1106 single-step mode | Approved plan exists, but implementation needs `cli/src/agent.ts`, currently claimed by the PR396 agent. | **Open; handoff required** |\\n| WP-1107 GBNF grammar | `9cb5f6de` prototype is unintegrated and lacks provider-path integration and validation. | **Open** |\\n| WP-1108 modernization | Branch `550112cd` is clean but has no PR or branch CI. Triage still calls for integrated CodeQL/dependency scans, compatibility and notice checks, reproducibility artifacts, and the broader G1.1-5 evidence. | **Partial, unqualified** |\\n\\n| Gate | Evidence required by roadmap | Status |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| G1.1-1 tracing | Valid OTel GenAI spans, credential safety, and trace-path confinement | **Open** |\\n| G1.1-2 dataset isolation | Full benchmark execution and proof that oracles do not reach candidate prompts | **Partial; exact-head suite and review open** |\\n| G1.1-3 CLI parity | Packaged CLI execution without developer dependencies | **Focused evidence exists; final candidate unverified** |\\n| G1.1-4 constrained decoding | At least 99.5% valid tool-call JSON across supported endpoints | **Open** |\\n| G1.1-5 dependency modernization | Zero deprecated/unmaintained packages and alerts, plus suite, cargo-deny, reproducibility, and compatibility evidence | **Open** |\\n\\nGitHub confirms v1.1.1 is published; v1.1.0 and v1.1.2 releases are absent. No v1.1.2 or RC tag is present. The scope correction is committed and approved on a separate local branch, but it has not been integrated into the WP-1104 branch. I made no edits, builds, or test runs for this audit.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/wp1108_acceptance_audit\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"WP-1108 is not ready for acceptance. Its branch is clean at `550112cd`, but it has no PR or branch-head CI evidence. The triage document records outstanding integrated CodeQL and Dependabot scans, runtime compatibility and notice-output checks, and package reproducibility evidence. The shared test process was still active, so no tests or builds were run.\\n\\nPreserve the existing branch. After the shared test host clears, WP-1108 could be claimed as a validation and integration slice, with its current commits and evidence gaps reviewed first. No edits or tests were made.\"}}]}","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a19c45-79f8-74d0-bea2-bdff6a04336d","create_time":1793623312.370219}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
