{"timestamp":"2026-11-02T12:58:13.666Z","ordinal":43379,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a19c56-c11f-7f20-b9e0-79a3b4d285c4","author":"/root/v112_unblocked_work","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/v112_unblocked_work\nPayload:\nNo additional roadmap item is safely pickable while the test host is occupied.\n\n- **WP-1105** has untracked evaluator work in its existing worktree and still depends on WP-1103; preserve it for its owner.\n- **WP-1106** has a planning-only claim; implementation needs `cli/src/agent.ts`, whose handoff is still pending.\n- **WP-1107** is already actively claimed by `codex-root`; its grammar source is modified in the owner’s worktree.\n- **WP-1108** has a clean branch, but its integrated scans and qualification evidence are outstanding; the audit says owner/claim alignment is still needed.\n\nThe release matrix confirms WP-1101 through WP-1108 and all five gates remain unqualified. The useful next step remains clearing the shared test traffic, then qualifying the exact WP-1103 integration source."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a19c45-79f8-74d0-bea2-bdff6a04336d","create_time":1793624293.6636355,"content_item_metadata":[{"provenance":{"type":"tool","namespace":"collaboration"}}]}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":1785}}
