{"timestamp":"2026-11-02T13:01:13.803Z","ordinal":43538,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a192c0-f277-7f60-8574-21ce71edb8c2","turn_id":"01a19c45-79f8-74d0-bea2-bdff6a04336d","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-b3977414-17aa-4924-84b7-5ad0d5596fb1","process_id":"9952","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","sed -n '8,22p' docs/releases/v1.1.2-qualification.md; tail -n 22 docs/releases/v1.1.2-qualification.md"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1104-integration","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"read","cmd":"sed -n '8,22p' docs/releases/v1.1.2-qualification.md","name":"v1.1.2-qualification.md","path":"docs/releases/v1.1.2-qualification.md"},{"type":"read","cmd":"tail -n 22 docs/releases/v1.1.2-qualification.md","name":"v1.1.2-qualification.md","path":"docs/releases/v1.1.2-qualification.md"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"\n| Package | Required outcome | Observed evidence | Status | Evidence still required for v1.1.2 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| WP-1101 — OpenTelemetry local tracing | Local GenAI spans for turns, model requests, tools, and compactions; credentials protected and trace output confined. | Prototype commit `8a83c9e7` lacks runtime event wiring and exact-head gate evidence. | **OPEN** | Integrated runtime wiring, tracing and redaction regressions, path-confinement proof, exact-head review and gates. |\n| WP-1102 — Flight recorder credential redaction | Zero-leak sanitization across traces, CLI errors, and debug journals. | Commit `ee7c8b1e` contains partial redaction work; operator acceptance remains pending. | **OPEN** | Full sink coverage, adversarial/credential fixtures, operator acceptance, and exact-head review. |\n| WP-1103 — Versioned evaluation datasets | Versioned datasets with separate examples/oracles and regression/benchmark splits; candidate prompts cannot access oracles. | Integration branch `v1/v112-wp1104-integration` is at `2a94f62e`; AC2 mount-view test passes 3/3 focused. The full snapshot run at `00a8cb4d` failed (2,133 pass, 3 fail, 2 skipped; log SHA-256 `e6ea08b2b56c3f1ada337290db9ae0601921a23f99fd1ca50e7d95b507f870e9`) during concurrent PR396 test traffic. The snapshot is not the exact integration source and has no process-scope postcheck. | **PARTIAL / UNQUALIFIED** | Clean serialized full suite and process-scope postcheck on the exact integration source; resolve or independently classify all failures; complete fresh full-slice review and candidate-specific evidence. |\n| WP-1104 — Standalone `nexus eval` | Packaged command supports dataset selection, run count, isolated home, and structured score output. | Source commits `05c49df2` and `2a94f62e` were reviewed; `npm run build` passed. Focused six-task installed-candidate acceptance is recorded in `WP-1104-PLAN.md`, but it is not final integrated-candidate qualification. | **SOURCE SLICE CLOSED / RELEASE GATE OPEN** | Re-run applicable checks on the final integrated candidate; prove package parity and installed CLI operation without developer dependencies; fresh independent review. |\n| WP-1105 — Deterministic code evaluators | Modular AST, build, typecheck, diff-boundary, and JSON-repair evaluators. | Worktree `v1/wp-1105-evaluators` has untracked `eval/evaluators/` files and no WP-1105 commit or test evidence. Its documented dependency on WP-1103 remains open. | **OPEN** | Resolve owner handoff while preserving existing files; complete implementation, tests, review, and exact-head gate after WP-1103. |\n| WP-1106 — Single-step loop mode | `--step` and `/step` pause deterministically after one agent turn for operator confirmation. | An independently approved plan exists. Implementation requires `cli/src/agent.ts`, currently claimed by the PR396 agent. | **OPEN** | Obtain file handoff, implement and test the plan, then review and qualify on the integrated head. |\n| WP-1107 — GBNF tool grammar | Generate tool-schema grammars and integrate supported provider paths. | Prototype commit `9cb5f6de` is unintegrated; provider-path integration and validation are missing. | **OPEN** | Integrate providers and demonstrate the roadmap reliability target on supported endpoints; exact-head tests and review. |\n| WP-1108 — Dependency modernization | Triage and integrate the 27 Dependabot updates while meeting the zero-deprecation and compatibility requirements. | Branch `v1/wp-1108-dependency-modernization` is clean at `550112cd`, but has no PR or branch CI. Its triage record still lists integrated CodeQL/dependency scans, runtime compatibility, notice comparisons, package reproducibility, and release artifacts as outstanding. | **PARTIAL / UNQUALIFIED** | Owner/claim alignment; integrated scans and alerts; required test/PTY, `cargo deny`, npm deprecation, CLI compatibility, reproducibility, archive, checksum, SBOM, and installer evidence. |\n\n## Release-gate status\n\n| Gate | Required proof | Current evidence | Status |\n\n| Gate | Required proof | Current evidence | Status |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| G1.1-1 — Zero-leak tracing | Valid OTel GenAI spans for all required turn steps, no credential leakage, and writes confined to the approved trace directory. | WP-1101 prototype lacks runtime wiring and gate evidence. | **OPEN** |\n| G1.1-2 — Dataset decoupling | All benchmark tasks execute and no oracle data reaches candidate prompts; exact candidate and process-scope evidence retained. | Six-task focused acceptance and AC2 focused test exist; the latest full run failed on a non-exact snapshot under concurrent test traffic. | **PARTIAL / UNQUALIFIED** |\n| G1.1-3 — CLI parity | Packaged `nexus eval` works without developer dependencies on the exact release candidate. | Focused installed-candidate evidence exists; final integrated candidate is unverified. | **PARTIAL / UNQUALIFIED** |\n| G1.1-4 — Constrained decoding | At least 99.5% valid tool-call JSON across the supported llama.cpp, vLLM, and Ollama endpoints. | No qualifying cross-endpoint result found. | **OPEN** |\n| G1.1-5 — Zero technical debt | Zero deprecated/unmaintained packages, zero CodeQL alerts and compiler warnings, plus required suite/PTY, cargo-deny, npm scans, reproducibility, and CLI option compatibility without breaking unprivileged sandbox invariants. | WP-1108 branch has no branch CI; integrated scan and qualification evidence remain outstanding. | **OPEN** |\n\n## Exact-candidate release checklist\n\nThe final candidate remains unqualified until each applicable item is recorded against one exact commit and its artifacts:\n\n- All WP-1101–WP-1108 acceptance evidence and independent reviews are complete.\n- The full test suite, type checks, lint/security gates, migration and compatibility checks pass on the exact head.\n- Linux package outputs, checksums, SBOM, installer behavior, and reproducibility are verified for that head.\n- CLI option compatibility is verified without weakening or bypassing unprivileged sandbox invariants.\n- Installed-candidate acceptance covers evaluator isolation, oracle exclusion, provider behavior, and relevant operator scenarios.\n- Independent release acceptance approves the exact candidate and evidence packet.\n- The v1.1.2 tag and public release assets are published only after all prior gates pass.\n\nNo v1.1.2 release, tag, or publication is recorded by this document. Update the status and attach evidence as gates are completed; do not convert a partial or historical result into a release pass.\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":777157423}},"started_at_ms":1793624473025,"completed_at_ms":1793624473803}}
